    {
      "id": "r0ta6tbC3zsRh95jGY6zJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2618.3384375107125,
      "y": 22055.58494019765,
      "width": 678.6463623046875,
      "height": 180.6188166891589,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bnY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1728489910,
      "version": 1081,
      "versionNonce": 709420906,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789370130274,
      "created": 1789369570739,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.变动的只有Conversation的input_revision\n2.最终获取Turn范围的的所有消息，最终目的\n3.能从哪里开始拿，到哪里结束，以及去哪里获取消息\nConverstaionTurn:start_revision：从哪里拿。【第一次从1】\nConversationTurn:snapshot_revision: 到哪里结束\n根据Message表的input_revision的值获取turn范围内的消息",
      "fontSize": 24.08250889188785,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.变动的只有Conversation的input_revision\n2.最终获取Turn范围的的所有消息，最终目的\n3.能从哪里开始拿，到哪里结束，以及去哪里获取消息\nConverstaionTurn:start_revision：从哪里拿。【第一次从1】\nConversationTurn:snapshot_revision: 到哪里结束\n根据Message表的input_revision的值获取turn范围内的消息",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "914-Y_O7jGfVUu0UZj5rM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1966.2459010230073,
      "y": 22020.129772618802,
      "width": 1007.1038208007812,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bna",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1413218294,
      "version": 526,
      "versionNonce": 1615620650,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789370130274,
      "created": 1789369765945,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "input_revision：只要有一条用户角色的输入消息，就+1\nanswered_revision：只要能将AI回复的结果存储到Message表中，那么就会更新\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "input_revision：只要有一条用户角色的输入消息，就+1\nanswered_revision：只要能将AI回复的结果存储到Message表中，那么就会更新\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
